      <title>李一帆断言：通用机器人要么全能，要么无能</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E6%9D%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%86%E6%96%AD%E8%A8%80%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E5%85%A8%E8%83%BD%E8%A6%81%E4%B9%88%E6%97%A0%E8%83%BD/</link>
